 4. 🚀 Starship soars despite diversion 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 The booster of SpaceX's Starship Flight 15 explodes after launching yesterday from Starbase, Texas. Photo: Ricardo Arduengo via Getty Images SpaceX's attempt to recover its entire Starship back at the launch pad was thwarted when the booster fell into the Gulf of Mexico and exploded yesterday. But the spacecraft still soared into orbit in its boldest test yet.

 Instead of returning to its Texas pad following liftoff, the first-stage booster was diverted to a point offshore. Despite the setback, the spacecraft continued on its way. Keep reading . 



 
 
